ics\n   314|http://localhost:9090\n   315|```\n   316|\n   317|---\n   318|\n   319|## 🔐 SECURITY MODEL\n   320|\n   321|### Network Security\n   322|- All services on localhost (127.0.0.1)\n   323|- External access via specific ports only\n   324|- Firewall rules: 18000-18100 range\n   325|- No Docker exposure (per requirements)\n   326|\n   327|### Authentication\n   328|- PostgreSQL: Per-user auth\n   329|- Redis: Password-protected\n   330|- MongoDB: Default (can enable auth)\n   331|- ClickHouse: Default (no auth)\n   332|- MinIO: Default credentials\n   333|- Qdrant: No auth (local)\n   334|\n   335|---\n   336|\n   337|## 🎯 USE CASES BY DATABASE\n   338|\n   339|### PostgreSQL (18030)\n   340|- **Primary**: Transactional data\n   341|- **Langfuse**: Traces, observations, scores\n   342|- **Users**: Projects, API keys, auth\n   343|- **Schema**: 60 models, Prisma-managed\n   344|\n   345|### MongoDB (18070)\n   346|- **Documents**: User profiles, flexible schemas\n   347|- **Logging**: Application logs with variable structure\n   348|- **Content**: Blog posts, articles, JSON data\n   349|- **Real-time**: Change streams, notifications\n   350|\n   351|### ClickHouse (18090)\n   352|- **Analytics**: Aggregations, reports\n   353|- **Time-series**: Metrics, events over time\n   354|- **CDR**: Data from Pulsar event stream\n   355|- **Dashboard**: Grafana integration\n   356|\n   357|### Redis Cluster (18010-18012)\n   358|- **Caching**: Session data, API responses\n   359|- **Queues**: Background job processing\n   360|- **Rate Limiting**: API throttling\n   361|- **Pub/Sub**: Real-time notifications\n   362|\n   363|### Qdrant (18050)\n   364|- **Vectors**: Document embeddings\n   365|- **RAG**: Retrieval-augmented generation\n   366|- **Similarity**: Content-based search\n   367|- **ML**: Machine learning features\n   368|\n   369|### MinIO (18092/18093)\n   370|- **Files**: Uploaded documents, media\n   371|- **Backups**: Database snapshots\n   372|- **Artifacts**: Model files, datasets\n   373|- **S3 API**: Cloud storage compatible\n   374|\n   375|### Pulsar (8080)\n   376|- **Events**: All database changes\n   377|- **Streams**: Real-time data pipelines\n   378|- **CDC**: Change data capture\n   379|- **Integration**: Inter-service messaging\n   380|\n   381|---\n   382|\n   383|## 📊 SCALING STRATEGY\n   384|\n   385|### Horizontal Scaling\n   386|- Redis Cluster: Add nodes (18013, 18014...)\n   387|- MongoDB: Sharded clusters\n   388|- ClickHouse: Distributed tables\n   389|- Pulsar: Multi-broker cluster\n   390|\n   391|### Vertical Scaling\n   392|- All services support:\n   393|  - Memory allocation\n   394|  - CPU cores\n   395|  - Disk I/O\n   396|  - Connection pooling\n   397|\n   398|---\n   399|\n   400|## 🛠️ TOOLS & DOCUMENTATION\n   401|\n   402|### Created Files\n   403|- `/adaptai/dbops/database-health-check.sh` - Health monitoring\n   404|- `/adaptai/dbops/PRISMA_MANAGEMENT.md` - Prisma workflow\n   405|- `/adaptai/dbops/MONGODB_README.md` - MongoDB guide\n   406|- `/adaptai/dbops/PULSAR_ARCHITECTURE.md` - Pulsar architecture\n   407|- `/adaptai/dbops/PRISMA_EXPLAINED.md` - Prisma documentation\n   408|- `/adaptai/dbops/LANGFUSE_INTEGRATION_BLOCKERS.md` - Langfuse guide\n   409|\n   410|### Service Configurations\n   411|- PostgreSQL: `/etc/postgresql/`\n   412|- MongoDB: `/etc/mongod.conf`\n   413|- Pulsar: `/opt/pulsar/conf/`\n   414|- ClickHouse: `/etc/clickhouse-server/`\n   415|- All documented and standardized\n   416|\n   417|---\n   418|\n   419|## 🎉 SUMMARY\n   420|\n   421|### TeamADAPT Infrastructure: **OPERATIONAL**\n   422|\n   423|**✅ 16 Critical Services Running**\n   424|**✅ 84% Health Check Pass Rate**  \n   425|**✅ Zero Critical Failures**\n   426|**✅ Cloud Migration Ready**\n   427|\n   428|### Memory & Communications Layer: **READY**\n   429|\n   430|**Pulsar** installed for event backbone\n   431|**NATS** operational for messaging\n   432|**RedPanda** ready for streaming\n   433|**F