equirements  \n\n### **2. Compliance**\n❌ No compliance framework (GDPR, SOC2, etc.)  \n❌ No data governance policies  \n❌ No retention policies  \n❌ No backup validation procedures  \n\n### **3. Change Management**\n❌ No change approval process  \n❌ No rollback procedures  \n❌ No testing requirements for changes  \n❌ No deployment windows defined  \n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ **IMMEDIATE ACTION ITEMS**\n\n### **Priority 1: Security (Fix Immediately)**\n1. **Remove hardcoded credentials** from all files\n2. **Implement secrets management** (HashiCorp Vault, AWS Secrets Manager)\n3. **Change all default passwords**\n4. **Create .env.template** files for environment variables\n5. **Add .env files to .gitignore**\n\n### **Priority 2: Governance (Fix Within 1 Week)**\n1. **Define ownership matrix** with names and responsibilities\n2. **Create access control policy** (who can do what)\n3. **Establish approval workflows** for schema changes\n4. **Document escalation procedures** for outages\n5. **Create backup/restore procedures**\n\n### **Priority 3: Protocols (Fix Within 2 Weeks)**\n1. **Code review process** for all changes\n2. **Testing strategy** beyond health checks\n3. **Disaster recovery plan**\n4. **Incident response procedures**\n5. **Performance SLAs** with monitoring\n\n---\n\n## ✅ **RECOMMENDATIONS**\n\n### **Short-term (1-4 weeks)**\n1. **Audit all credentials** and move to secrets manager\n2. **Create ownership documentation** with team roster\n3. **Implement basic access controls** for admin interfaces\n4. **Document change management process**\n\n### **Medium-term (1-3 months)**\n1. **Deploy proper authentication** for all services\n2. **Implement audit logging** for all database operations\n3. **Create disaster recovery** and business continuity plans\n4. **Establish compliance frameworks**\n\n### **Long-term (3-6 months)**\n1. **Full RBAC implementation**\n2. **Security scanning** in CI/CD pipeline\n3. **Compliance automation**\n4. **Governance dashboards** for ove