eview and approve all major database changes\n- Lead proof-of-concepts and technology evaluations\n- Report architectural decisions and technology roadmaps to me\n\n**Career Path:** Architect → Senior Architect → Architecture Lead → Principal Architect (me)\n\n---\n\n### **3. DATA SECURITY LEAD**\n**Span:** 5 Tier 3 security specialists  \n**Accountability:** Security posture and compliance of all data systems\n\n**What They Do:**\n- Own security strategy for all data systems\n- Manage compliance frameworks (SOC2, GDPR, HIPAA)\n- Lead security reviews and penetration testing\n- Make security decisions for database configurations\n- Report security posture and compliance status to me\n\n**Career Path:** Security Engineer → Senior Security Engineer → Security Lead → Security Architect\n\n---\n\n### **4. DATA PLATFORM LEAD**\n**Span:** 5 Tier 3 platform engineers  \n**Accountability:** Infrastructure and platform tools for the data ecosystem\n\n**What They Do:**\n- Own infrastructure-as-code for all database systems\n- Manage CI/CD and automation for database deployments\n- Build and maintain internal platform tools\n- Own monitoring and observability infrastructure\n- Report infrastructure health and platform capabilities to me\n\n**Career Path:** Platform Engineer → Senior Platform Engineer → Platform Lead → Principal Platform Engineer\n\n---\n\n### **5. ETL ENGINEERING LEAD**\n**Span:** 5 Tier 3 data engineers  \n**Accountability:** Data movement, integration, and streaming pipelines\n\n**What They Do:**\n- Own all data pipelines and ETL processes\n- Manage data quality and validation\n- Lead streaming and real-time data initiatives\n- Make decisions on streaming technology choices\n- Report data pipeline health and capabilities to me\n\n**Career Path:** Data Engineer → Senior Data Engineer → ETL Lead → Principal Data Engineer\n\n---\n\n## 🛠️ **TIER 3 SPECIALISTS (25 ENGINEERS)**\n\n### **UNDER: DATABASE RELIABILITY LEAD**\n\n**1. PostgreSQL SRE**\n- Owns PostgreSQL