            "arguments": {
              "content": "# AdaptAI DataOps Platform\n\n**Created**: 2025-11-22  \n**Owner**: Principal Database Architect (DataOps Technical Lead)  \n**Context**: Fortune 500 startup scale, 8,000-10,000 AI agents, 100% AI-driven operations  \n\n---\n\n## 📁 **PLATFORM STRUCTURE**\n\n### **Direct Platform Teams**\n\n- **[Tier2-DatabaseOperations](Tier2-DatabaseOperations/)** - Database reliability, operations, scaling\n  - *Moved from: `/adaptai/dbops`*\n  - *Purpose: Own all database operations for AI agents*\n  - *Current Status: 19 services, 17/19 operational (89%)*\n\n- **[Tier2-DataArchitecture](Tier2-DataArchitecture/)** - Strategic data platform design\n  - *Purpose: Database technology selection, patterns, standards*\n  - *Focus: AI-scale data architectures, 11 domains*\n\n- **[Tier2-DataSecurity](Tier2-DataSecurity/)** - Security & compliance for data systems\n  - *Purpose: Data security, compliance, access controls*\n  - *Focus: AI agent data protection, regulatory compliance*\n\n- **[Tier2-DataPlatform](Tier2-DataPlatform/)** - Infrastructure & automation\n  - *Purpose: Infrastructure, automation, CI/CD*\n  - *Focus: Cloud migration, Nebius.ai deployment, Kubernetes*\n\n- **[Tier2-DataEngineering](Tier2-DataEngineering/)** - ETL & streaming\n  - *Purpose: Data pipelines, streaming, integration*\n  - *Focus: High-volume agent data movement, real-time processing*\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 **DATAOPS VISION**\n\n### **Mission Statement:**\n*\"Design and operate autonomous data infrastructure that scales seamlessly from 19 services to support 8,000-10,000 AI agents across 11 domains with 100% automated operations.\"*\n\n### **Core Principles:**\n- **AI-First Operations**: Every process automated for AI agents\n- **Massive Scale Ready**: Design for 10,000+ concurrent agents\n- **Domain-Driven**: Support 11 distinct operational domains\n- **Self-Healing**: Autonomous detection, diagnosis, and repair\n- **Cloud-Native**: Nebius.ai-first, Kubernetes orchestration\n- **Compliance-by-Design**: Built-in security and regulatory compliance\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 **DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY**\n\n### **Phase 1: Foundation (Current)**\n- **Infrastructure**: 19 services on laptop, 17/19 operational\n- **Team**: 1 Principal Database Architect + DBOps specialists\n- **Cloud**: Preparation for Nebius.ai migration (3 days)\n- **Documentation**: `/adaptai/db.env` as source of truth\n\n### **Phase 2: Cloud Migration & Tier 2 Deployment**\n- **Timeline**: Next 3 days (immediate)\n- **Migration**: Laptop → Nebius.ai cloud infrastructure\n- **Team**: Deploy tier 2 team leads (5 teams)\n- **Scale**: Support 1,000-3,000 agents\n\n### **Phase 3: AI-Scale Operations**\n- **Timeline**: Month 1-2\n- **Team**: Full tier 2 + tier 3 teams (20-30 people)\n- **Scale**: Support 8,000-10,000 agents\n- **Operations**: 100% AI-driven, autonomous\n\n---\n\n## 📊 **CURRENT STATUS**\n\n### **Infrastructure Health**\n- **Total Services**: 19\n- **Operational**: 17 (89%)\n- **Warnings**: 2 (Neo4j, pgAdmin)\n- **Critical Failures**: 0\n\n### **Services Inventory**\n1. ✅ DragonflyDB Cluster (18000-18002)\n2. ✅ Redis Cluster (18010-18012)\n3. ✅ RedPanda (18020)\n4. ✅ PostgreSQL (18030)\n5. ✅ Neo4j (18060-18061) [⚠️ Warning]\n6. ✅ Weaviate (18050-18051)\n7. ✅ NATS (18070)\n8. ✅ QuestDB (18091)\n9. ✅ ClickHouse (9000/8123)\n10. ✅ FAISS (Python)\n11. ✅ Elasticsearch Client (Python)\n12. ✅ Materialize CLI\n13. ✅ ClickHouse Client\n14. ✅ Prometheus (9090)\n15. ✅ Grafana (3000)\n16. ✅ pgAdmin (5432) [⚠️ Warning]\n17. ✅ MongoDB (18070)\n18. ✅ Pulsar (8080)\n19. ✅ MinIO (18092/18093)\n\n### **Strategic Capabilities**\n- **Polyglot Persistence**: 7+ database types\n- **Event Streaming**: Pulsar, RedPanda, NATS\n- **AI/ML Ready**: Weaviate, FAISS vectors\n- **Cloud Migration**: Ready for Nebius.ai\n- **Monitoring**: Prometheus + Grafana\n- **Health Monitoring**: Automated checks\n\n---\n\n## 🏗️ **CLOUD DEPLOYMENT ARCHITECTURE**\n\n### **Nebius.ai Infrastructure**\n- **Kubernetes Clusters**: One per domain (11 clusters)\n- **Database Services**: Cloud-native deployments\n- **Storage**: Distributed, multi-tier (SSD + HDD)\n- **Networking**: VPC, security groups, load balancers\n- **Monitoring**: Cloud-native observability stack\n\n### **AI Agent Data Flow**\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ AI AGENTS (8,000-10,000)                                 │\n│ • Generate data continuously                             │\n│ • Operate across 11 domains                             │\n│ • Require real-time processing                          │\n└─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘\n                  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ DATAOPS PLATFORM                                         │\n│ ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │\n│ │ DOMAIN 1  │ DOMAIN 2  │ ... │ DOMAIN 11            │ │\n│ │ Cluster   │ Cluster   │     │ Cluster              │ │\n│ │ • Agents  │ • Agents  │     │ • Agents             │ │\n│ │ • Data    │ • Data    │     │ • Data               │ │\n│ └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │\n└─────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘\n                  ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│ CENTRAL DATA PLATFORM                                    │\n│ • Cross-domain analytics                                 │\n│ • Global monitoring                                     │\n│ • AI-driven optimization                                │\n│ • Compliance & governance                               │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📋 **NEXT ACTIONS**\n\n### **Immediate (Next 3 Days)**\n1. ✅ **Complete platform structure** (current task)\n2. 🔄 **Deploy tier 2 teams** to Nebius.ai\n3. 🔄 **Migrate 19 services** to cloud\n4. 🔄 **Setup monitoring** for AI-scale operations\n5. 🔄 **Begin tier 3 team planning**\n\n### **Week 1 (Post-Migration)**\n1. **Scale testing**: Load test with simulated agents\n2. **Team expansion**: Hire tier 2 leads (5 teams)\n3. **Domain architecture**: Design 11-domain data patterns\n4. **AI operations**: Implement autonomous monitoring\n5. **Security**: Deploy AI-agent security frameworks\n\n### **Month 1**\n1. **Full tier 2 deployment**: All 5 teams operational\n2. **1,000 agent support**: Scale to 1K concurrent agents\n3. **AI-driven optimization**: Predictive scaling, anomaly detection\n4. **Compliance frameworks**: SOC2, GDPR for AI operations\n5. **Team building**: Begin tier 3 specialist hiring\n\n---\n\n## 💡 **KEY INNOVATIONS**\n\n### **AI-Specific Data Challenges:**\n- **Agent Memory**: Long-term vs short-term data separation\n- **Inter-Agent Communication**: Event streaming for 10K agents\n- **Domain Isolation**: Secure, isolated data per domain\n- **Real-time Analytics**: Sub-second insights on AI behavior\n- **Predictive Operations**: AI monitoring AI operations\n\n### **Technical Innovations:**\n- **Database per Domain**: 11 isolated database clusters\n- **Event-Driven Everything**: Agents communicate via events\n- **AI-Generated Monitoring**: Self-writing monitoring rules\n- **Autonomous Scaling**: AI predicts and scales capacity\n- **Domain-Specific Optimization**: Tailored per operational domain\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 **SUCCESS METRICS**\n\n### **Technical KPIs**\n- **Uptime**: 99.99% for AI agent operations\n- **Latency**: <10ms for agent-to-agent communication\n- **Throughput**: 1M+ events/second across all domains\n- **Scalability**: Support 10K+ concurrent agents\n- **Recovery**: <30 seconds for any service failure\n\n### **Operational KPIs**\n- **Automation**: 100% of routine operations automated\n- **Team Productivity**: Support 10K agents with <50 people\n- **Cost Efficiency**: <$1/month per AI agent operational cost\n- **Security**: Zero data breaches or compliance violations\n- **Innovation**: Deploy new features in <24 hours\n\n---\n\n## 🤝 **TEAM COORDINATION**\n\n### **With Other Tier 1 Leads**\n- **MemOps**: Shared memory architectures, agent state management\n- **SignalCore**: Event streaming integration, real-time communications\n- **Platform Teams**: Infrastructure coordination, resource allocation\n\n### **Cross-Functional Dependencies**\n- **Application Teams**: API specifications, data contracts\n- **Security Teams**: AI agent authentication, domain isolation\n- **Infrastructure Teams**: Cloud resource management, networking\n- **Compliance Teams**: AI operations governance, regulatory alignment\n\n---\n\n*This platform document serves as the master reference for AdaptAI DataOps operations. All tier 2 teams should align with this vision and architecture.*\n",
