            "arguments": {
              "content": "# AdaptAI DataOps Platform\n\n**Enterprise Data Operations for 8,000-10,000 AI Agents**\n\n---\n\n## 🏢 **PLATFORM OVERVIEW**\n\nThis is the **AdaptAI DataOps Platform** - a comprehensive data infrastructure designed to support **8,000-10,000 concurrent AI agents** across **11 operational domains** with **100% AI-driven operations**.\n\n### **Current Status**\n- **Infrastructure**: 19 services, 17/19 operational (89%)\n- **Team**: Principal Database Architect + DBOps specialists  \n- **Deployment**: Laptop foundation → Nebius.ai cloud migration (3 days)\n- **Scale Target**: Support 10K AI agents with autonomous operations\n\n---\n\n## 📁 **DIRECTORY STRUCTURE**\n\n### **Platform Teams (Tier 2)**\n\n| Team | Purpose | Current Status |\n|------|---------|----------------|\n| **[Tier2-DatabaseOperations](Tier2-DatabaseOperations/)** | Database reliability, operations, scaling | ✅ Deployed (moved from /adaptai/dbops) |\n| **[Tier2-DataArchitecture](Tier2-DataArchitecture/)** | Strategic data platform design | 🔄 To be deployed |\n| **[Tier2-DataSecurity](Tier2-DataSecurity/)** | Security & compliance | 🔄 To be deployed |\n| **[Tier2-DataPlatform](Tier2-DataPlatform/)** | Infrastructure & automation | 🔄 To be deployed |\n| **[Tier2-DataEngineering](Tier2-DataEngineering/)** | ETL & streaming | 🔄 To be deployed |\n\n### **Best Practices & Standards**\n\n| Category | Documentation | Description |\n|----------|---------------|-------------|\n| **[Architecture](best-practices/architecture/)** | AI-scale data architectures | Patterns for 10K agent operations |\n| **[Security](best-practices/security/)** | AI agent security frameworks | Domain isolation, encryption, compliance |\n| **[Operations](best-practices/operations/)** | Operational runbooks | Automated procedures for AI operations |\n| **[Automation](best-practices/automation/)** | Self-healing systems | AI-driven monitoring, scaling, recovery |\n| **[Monitoring](best-practices/monitoring/)** | Observability for AI agents | Metrics, logs, traces for AI-scale systems |\n| **[Compliance](best-practices/compliance/)** | Regulatory frameworks | SOC2, GDPR for AI operations |\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 **QUICK START**\n\n### **For Team Members**\n1. **Read**: [PLATFORM_OVERVIEW.md](PLATFORM_OVERVIEW.md) for complete context\n2. **Review**: [Tier2-DatabaseOperations](Tier2-DatabaseOperations/) for current infrastructure\n3. **Check**: `/adaptai/db.env` for current service configurations\n4. **Monitor**: Run `database-health-check.sh` for current status\n\n### **For Leadership**\n1. **Infrastructure Health**: 89% operational (17/19 services)\n2. **Cloud Migration**: Scheduled for next 3 days to Nebius.ai\n3. **Team Scaling**: Tier 2 deployment starting immediately\n4. **AI Agent Scale**: Architecture ready for 10K concurrent agents\n\n---\n\n## 📊 **CURRENT INFRASTRUCTURE**\n\n### **19 Services Across 3 Layers**\n\n#### **Layer 1: Storage (7 Databases)**\n- PostgreSQL 16 (18030) - Primary OLTP\n- MongoDB 7.0 (18070) - Document storage  \n- ClickHouse (18090) - Analytics OLAP\n- Redis Cluster (18010-18012) - Caching\n- DragonflyDB (18000-18002) - High-performance cache\n- Qdrant (18050) - Vector database\n- MinIO (18092/18093) - Object storage\n\n#### **Layer 2: Memory & Communications (3 Systems)**\n- Apache Pulsar (8080) - Event streaming backbone\n- NATS (18020) - Lightweight messaging\n- RedPanda (18020) - High-throughput streaming\n\n#### **Layer 3: Monitoring & Tools (9 Services)**\n- Prometheus (9090) - Metrics collection\n- Grafana (3000) - Visualization\n- FAISS (Python) - Local vector search\n- Elasticsearch Client (Python) - Search analytics\n- Materialize CLI - Streaming SQL\n- And 4 more operational services...\n\n**Health Check**: Run `/adaptai/adapt/platform/dataops/Tier2-DatabaseOperations/database-health-check.sh`\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 **DEPLOYMENT ROADMAP**\n\n### **Phase 1: Cloud Migration (Next 3 Days)**\n```\n✅ Current: Laptop infrastructure (19 services)\n🔄 Next: Nebius.ai cloud deployment\n🎯 Goal: Production-ready AI agent infrastructure\n```\n\n### **Phase 2: Team Deployment (Week 1)**\n```\n🔄 Deploy: All 5 Tier 2 teams\n🎯 Goal: 20-30 person organization\n📈 Scale: Support 1,000-3,000 agents\n```\n\n### **Phase 3: AI-Scale Operations (Month 1-6)**\n```\n🎯 Goal: 8,000-10,000 concurrent agents\n🤖 Operations: 100% AI-driven, autonomous\n💰 Efficiency: <$1/month per agent operational cost\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 **KEY TECHNOLOGIES**\n\n### **Database Stack**\n- **PostgreSQL**: Transactional data, ACID compliance\n- **MongoDB**: Flexible document storage\n- **ClickHouse**: Real-time analytics, OLAP\n- **Redis/DragonflyDB**: High-performance caching\n- **Qdrant**: AI vector storage, embeddings\n\n### **Streaming & Messaging**\n- **Apache Pulsar**: Event backbone, CDC\n- **NATS**: Microservices communication\n- **RedPanda**: High-throughput streaming\n\n### **Cloud & Orchestration**\n- **Nebius.ai**: Primary cloud platform\n- **Kubernetes**: Container orchestration\n- **Terraform**: Infrastructure as Code\n\n### **AI & Monitoring**\n- **FAISS**: Local vector search\n- **Prometheus**: Metrics collection\n- **Grafana**: Real-time dashboards\n\n---\n\n## 📋 **TEAM RESPONSIBILITIES**\n\n### **Tier 1: Principal Database Architect**\n- **Overall Strategy**: Data platform vision and architecture\n- **Team Leadership**: Hire and manage tier 2 teams\n- **Cloud Migration**: Lead Nebius.ai deployment\n- **Stakeholder Management**: Coordinate with other tier 1 leads\n\n### **Tier 2: Team Leads (5 Teams)**\n1. **Database Operations**: Reliability, uptime, incident response\n2. **Data Architecture**: Technology selection, patterns, standards\n3. **Data Security**: Security, compliance, access controls\n4. **Data Platform**: Infrastructure, automation, CI/CD\n5. **Data Engineering**: ETL, streaming, integration\n\n### **Tier 3: Specialists (Planned)**\n- 25 senior engineers and specialists\n- Database-specific experts\n- AI-scale operations specialists\n- Cross-functional technical roles\n\n---\n\n## 🔐 **SECURITY & COMPLIANCE**\n\n### **AI Agent Security**\n- **Domain Isolation**: Secure data separation across 11 domains\n- **Agent Authentication**: Secure inter-agent communication\n- **Data Encryption**: End-to-end encryption for all agent data\n- **Access Controls**: Role-based access for AI agents\n\n### **Compliance Frameworks**\n- **SOC2 Type II**: Security, availability, confidentiality\n- **GDPR**: Data protection for EU operations\n- **AI Governance**: Ethical AI operations, bias detection\n- **Audit Trails**: Complete auditability of AI agent actions\n\n---\n\n## 📈 **PERFORMANCE TARGETS**\n\n### **Scale Targets**\n- **Concurrent Agents**: 8,000-10,000\n- **Events/Second**: 1M+ across all domains\n- **Data Storage**: Petabyte scale\n- **Query Latency**: <10ms for agent communication\n- **System Uptime**: 99.99%\n\n### **Operational Targets**\n- **Automation**: 100% routine operations automated\n- **Team Efficiency**: <50 people supporting 10K agents\n- **Cost Efficiency**: <$1/month per agent\n- **Recovery Time**: <30 seconds for any failure\n- **Deployment Speed**: New features in <24 hours\n\n---\n\n## 🤝 **STAKEHOLDER COORDINATION**\n\n### **Other Tier 1 Leads**\n- **MemOps**: Shared memory architectures, agent state\n- **SignalCore**: Event streaming integration, real-time comms\n- **Infrastructure**: Cloud resource management\n- **Security**: AI agent authentication, domain isolation\n\n### **External Dependencies**\n- **Nebius.ai**: Cloud infrastructure provider\n- **Compliance Teams**: Regulatory frameworks\n- **Application Teams**: API specifications, data contracts\n- **Business Stakeholders**: ROI, business value delivery\n\n---\n\n## 📞 **EMERGENCY CONTACTS**\n\n### **DataOps Leadership**\n- **Principal Database Architect**: DataOps Technical Lead\n- **Tier 2 Team Leads**: Database Ops, Architecture, Security, Platform, Engineering\n- **On-Call**: 24/7 for critical infrastructure issues\n\n### **Escalation Path**\n1. **Tier 3 Specialists**: Day-to-day technical issues\n2. **Tier 2 Team Leads**: Operational decisions, team coordination\n3. **Tier 1 Principal**: Strategic decisions, major incidents\n4. **Executive Leadership**: Business-impacting decisions\n\n---\n\n**Last Updated**: 2025-11-22  \n**Next Review**: Post-Nebius.ai migration  \n**Document Owner**: Principal Database Architect\n\n*This platform supports AdaptAI's mission to build the world's most advanced AI agent infrastructure at enterprise scale.*\n",
